@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

autonumber

actor "Player" as Employee
participant ":System" as System

activate Employee

    Employee -> System : Ask to build a station
    activate System

        System --> Employee : Verify if is alowed to build a station and show station types
    deactivate System

    Employee -> System : select station type
    activate System

        System --> Employee :  ask for location
    deactivate System

    Employee -> System : Give location
    activate System

        System --> Employee : request name, (and centre if station) and sugest name
    deactivate System

    Employee -> System : type requested information
    activate System

        System --> Employee : show all information and request confirmation
    deactivate System
    Employee -> System : Confirm information
    activate System
    System -> Employee : display operation sucess and build station

@enduml